    "summary": "UB can be reached from safe code",
    "details": "The variance of `RefSwap` and `OptionRefSwap` were incorrect, possibly allowing use-after-free.\n\n`OptionRefSwap::into_inner` did not check for null.\n\nThe fix is to make `RefSwap` and `OptionRefSwap` invariant, and to change `OptionRefSwap::into_inner` to return an option.\nIt is available in version 0.1.3.\nIf your project still compiles with 0.1.3 then it is not affected by the unsoundness on version 0.1.2",
